        "TileImage": "$($repository fddb2a2f-9710-4676-aa04-5acee82dbc5b).Image",
        "Description": "Listen to your dear god, whom we hail as Bob, wielding spaghetti thunderstorms, and do send these non-believers into Hiccupia.\r\rSome target details for you:\r\rAmos Dexter - He disrupted my watching of Hatsune Miku&apos;s World is Mine, while yapping about resurrecting Bagel. I am Bagel, and Bob is Bagel. Eliminate him for trespassing such theories!\r\r- Archie Ryan - He just stinks. He has a scent that horrifies me, poison him and make it as un-noticed.",
